title: '?'
pid: f893be55-08a8-47d7-8d0b-441ed9eef015
body: |2-
  If the link it replaces with content has no other relationships
  beyond the one just removed from its parent --
  that is, if the link becomes an island --
  it should be deleted.
  But not if it retains other relationships, in or out,
  including non-content relationships.
